          <div class="exp-role-badge role-polestar">
            <span>Software Engineer &bull; Maritime Intelligence &amp; AI</span>
          </div>

          <p class="exp-story">
            At Pole Star, I build backend systems for maritime intelligence, where <strong>reliability and zero downtime are non-negotiable</strong>. I work on our COMMS platform ingesting real-time vessel positions across global satellite networks (Inmarsat, Globalstar, Orbcomm) using <code>Python</code>, <code>Kafka</code>, and <code>AWS</code>. A major highlight for me was my hackathon project: it started as a simple <code>AWS Bedrock</code> agent doing text-to-SQL, won the internal hackathon, and is now live in production, actively used by enterprise customers and powered by <code>LangGraph</code>, <code>LangChain</code>, and <code>MCP (Model Context Protocol)</code> servers to query complex maritime insights.
          </p>

